title: Treasury Consultation
new-page: true

= Treasury Department

Which matter would you like to bring before the Treasury?

- @go_fiscal: Fiscal Policy
- @go_monetary: Monetary Policy
- @cancel_treasury: Never mind

@go_fiscal
choose-if: fiscal_policy_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if fiscal_policy_timer > 0 : [+ fiscal_policy_timer +] months remaining. ?]
go-to: fiscal_policy

@go_monetary
choose-if: monetary_policy_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if monetary_policy_timer > 0 : [+ monetary_policy_timer +] months remaining. ?]
go-to: economic_policy

@cancel_treasury
go-to: root